---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /plays/
title: The Plays
description: The play of the day, the survivor pick and the daily fantasy lineup, written down before kickoff and graded the next morning. One play at a time, never a parlay, and the record is the whole record.
---
{% set p = rankings.plays %}
<div style="text-align:center;padding:32px 0 22px">
  <div class="kick" style="margin-bottom:10px">Written down before kickoff</div>
  <h1 class="hed-xl">The Plays</h1>
  <p class="standfirst" style="margin-top:12px;max-width:640px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto">
    A play of the day, a survivor pick each week, and a daily fantasy lineup when I'm playing one. Every one of them goes up before the game and gets graded the morning after, from the box score.
  </p>
</div>

{% if p %}
<div class="dateline"><span>Season {{ p.season }}</span><span>Props {{ p.tally.props.hit }}&ndash;{{ p.tally.props.miss }}{% if p.tally.props.push %}&ndash;{{ p.tally.props.push }}{% endif %}{% if p.tally.props.open %} &middot; {{ p.tally.props.open }} open{% endif %}</span><span>Survivor {{ p.tally.survivor.hit }}&ndash;{{ p.tally.survivor.miss }}{% if p.tally.survivor.open %} &middot; {{ p.tally.survivor.open }} open{% endif %}</span></div>
<div class="r-light"></div>
{% endif %}

{# the house rules: the ethics of the page, said plainly, once #}
<div class="caveat" id="house-rules">
  <span class="sec">The House Rules</span>
  <p>I'm not a betting account. I rank players here, and sometimes watching a game with a number in mind makes it more fun. That's what this page is: the plays I actually make, written down before kickoff and graded the next morning, with the record kept whether it's good or bad.</p>
  <p><b>One play at a time.</b> I don't post parlays. The book's edge compounds with every leg, and a nine-leg card is a lottery ticket with a nicer font.</p>
  <p><b>The number comes first.</b> Every play carries the line I saw and where I saw it, so if your book is different, you know before you tap.</p>
  <p><b>Everything gets graded.</b> Hit, push or miss, from the box score, the morning after. Nothing gets deleted. The record on this page is the whole record.</p>
  <p><b>Nobody pays for a pick.</b> If a link on this page ever earns me something, it will say so right next to the link. No operator has a say in which players show up here, and the rankings never know this page exists.</p>
  <p><b>Bet small or not at all.</b> Legal age in your state, money you'd spend on a night out, and stop the moment it stops being fun. If it already has, call or text 1-800-GAMBLER.</p>
  <p class="summary" style="margin-top:12px">Season-long calls, the bold predictions and the flag plant, live on <a href="/accuracy/">the Accuracy page</a>. This is the day-to-day.</p>
</div>

{% if p and p.props.length %}
<div class="box">
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="sec">Play of the Day</span><span class="kick">{{ p.tally.props.graded }} graded &middot; {{ p.tally.props.open }} open</span></div>
  <div class="tbl-wrap receipt">
    <table class="rank record">
      <thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Player</th><th>The play</th><th>The line</th><th>Why</th><th>What happened</th><th></th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
      {% for c in p.props %}
      <tr>
        <td class="c-date" style="white-space:nowrap">{{ c.date | date("short") }}<div class="m" style="color:var(--muted);font-size:12px">{{ c.game }}</div></td>
        <td class="c-player">{% if c.player in rankings.playerNames %}<a href="/players/{{ c.player | slugify }}/">{{ c.player }}</a>{% else %}{{ c.player }}{% endif %}<div class="kick">{{ c.pos }}{% if c.team %} &middot; {{ c.team }}{% endif %}</div></td>
        <td class="c-call"><b>{{ c.call }}</b>{% if c.post %} <a class="m" href="{{ c.post }}">the post</a>{% endif %}</td>
        <td class="c-rule">{{ c.line }}</td>
        <td class="c-rule">{{ c.why }}</td>
        <td class="c-standing">{{ c.result }}</td>
        <td><span class="g {{ c.grade }}">{{ c.grade }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class="tbl-foot">One player, one number, one side. Hit = cleared the number; Push = landed on it; Miss = didn't. Graded the next morning, never edited after.</div>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if p and p.survivor.length %}
<div class="box">
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="sec">Survivor</span><span class="kick">{{ p.tally.survivor.hit }} alive weeks &middot; {{ p.tally.survivor.miss }} out</span></div>
  <div class="classified receipt">
    {% for s in p.survivor %}
    <div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start">
      <div><b>Week {{ s.week }} &middot; {{ s.pick }}</b>{% if s.opponent %} vs {{ s.opponent }}{% endif %}{% if s.why %}<div class="summary" style="margin-top:2px">{{ s.why }}</div>{% endif %}{% if s.result %}<div class="summary" style="margin-top:2px">{{ s.result }}</div>{% endif %}</div>
      <span class="g {{ s.grade }}">{{ s.grade }}</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="tbl-foot">One team a week, never the same team twice. Hit = still alive; Miss = the season's over.</div>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if p and p.dfs.length %}
<div class="box">
  <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap"><span class="sec">Daily Fantasy</span><span class="kick">{{ p.tally.dfs.graded }} slates</span></div>
  <div class="classified receipt">
    {% for d in p.dfs %}
    <div class="row" style="align-items:flex-start">
      <div><b>{{ d.date | date("short") }} &middot; {{ d.slate }}</b>{% if d.site %} <span class="m">{{ d.site }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% if d.lineup.length %}<div class="summary" style="margin-top:2px">{{ d.lineup | join(" · ") }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if d.note %}<div class="summary" style="margin-top:2px">{{ d.note }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if d.result or d.score !== null %}<div class="summary" style="margin-top:2px">{% if d.score !== null %}{{ d.score }} points. {% endif %}{{ d.result }}</div>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <span class="g {{ d.grade }}">{{ d.grade }}</span>
    </div>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="tbl-foot">The lineup as entered, the score as posted. Hit = cashed; Miss = didn't.</div>
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if not p or (not p.props.length and not p.survivor.length and not p.dfs.length) %}
<div style="border-top:2px solid var(--ink);padding:22px 0">
  <span class="sec">Nothing on the board yet</span>
  <p class="summary" style="margin-top:8px;max-width:620px">The first play goes up the morning of the first game and gets graded the morning after.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<div class="tbl-foot" style="margin-top:28px">For entertainment. Not financial advice, not a guarantee, and past results don't predict the next one. I don't take bets and I don't handle anyone's money. You must be of legal age in your jurisdiction to play. Problem gambling help: 1-800-GAMBLER.</div>
